  "formula": "n2 = (1 + 2q) / (1 - q), q = N_A alpha / (3 V_m); A = N_A mu^2 / (9 eps0 k_B T V_m); eps = (L + sqrt(L^2 + 8 n2^2)) / 4, L = n2 + A (n2 + 2)^2",
